Package: agregR
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian State-Space Aggregation of Brazilian Electoral Polls
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rafael N.", "Magalhães", email = "rnunesmagalhaes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Bayesian state-space models in Stan to aggregate Brazilian electoral polling data. Estimates latent voting intentions by accounting for house effects, non-sampling errors, and daily trends. Features specialized methods for retrospective analysis, bias adjustment based on past performance, and correction for asymmetric errors based on candidate political alignment.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    ggdist (>= 3.1.0),
    grid
